{
	title: "What The Hell Is All This?",
	icon: "gregtech:warning_sign 1 2",
	x: 21.5d,
	y: 3.0d,
	text: [
		"Welcome to gregicality nuclear - your means of obtaining neptunium, plutonium, americium, curium, berkelium, californium, einstienium, fermium, and mendelevium, along with the majority of elements in smaller quantities.",
		"",
		"Nuclear can be summarized as a ladder, with rungs consisting of fissile elements starting with uranium. Each element must be processed into isotopes and run through a reactor to create depleted fuel, which can be processed for a dust of the next 'rung' on the ladder. For instance, depleted uranium is processed into neptunium. ",
		"",
		"You will have to climb the entire nuclear ladder in some way eventually, but to start with familiarizing yourself with how uranium is processed since the other elements are processed using the same first eight steps."
	],
